  {
    "title": "An update on independent evaluators",
    "summary": "Last month, we committed to stronger independent, third-party assessment of our models and safety practices. We also sig...",
    "full_content": "<article class=\"\"><div class=\"page-wrapper PostDetail-module-scss-module__UQuRMa__hero\"><div class=\"PostDetail-module-scss-module__UQuRMa__illustrationHeroWrapper\"><img alt=\"An update on independent evaluators\" class=\"PostDetail-module-scss-module__UQuRMa__heroImage\" height=\"1125\" src=\"https://www-cdn.anthropic.com/images/4zrzovbb/website/6f3b6a11013128a8d7d8edc627ce758917b4e33d-2000x1125.jpg\" width=\"2000\" /></div></div><div class=\"page-wrapper\"><article><div class=\"\"><div class=\"Body-module-scss-module__z40yvW__body\"><p class=\"Body-module-scss-module__z40yvW__reading-column body-2 serif post-text\">Last month, we committed to <a href=\"https://darioamodei.com/post/we-must-pace-the-frontier\">stronger independent, third-party assessment</a> of our models and safety practices. We also signed the White House Accord on Super Intelligence, in which companies pledged to partner with independent external auditors or evaluators. Today, we’re announcing that we’ve started to give employee-like access to a team from <a href=\"https://metr.org/\">METR</a>, a nonprofit that evaluates frontier AI models.</p><p class=\"Body-module-scss-module__z40yvW__reading-column body-2 serif post-text\"></p><p class=\"Body-module-scss-module__z40yvW__reading-column body-2 serif post-text\">METR will publish the results of its risk assessments. Over the past year, we’ve worked with METR on <a href=\"https://metr.org/risk-assessment/\">several reviews of our Risk Reports</a>. We’re also working with <a href=\"https://securebio.org/\">SecureBio</a> and <a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/news/accenture-embedded-evaluation\">Accenture</a> as evaluators, and are in early discussions with several other organizations, including <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/\">Hugging Face</a>.</p>…",
    "category": "ai",
    "categoryName": "AI/大模型",
    "date": "2026-10-15",
